; exports.def — Explicit symbol export list for Aion2FunDps.Engine.dll
;
; Why a .def file instead of relying on __declspec(dllexport):
;   - Guarantees stable, undecorated symbol names in the DLL exports table
;     regardless of compiler / calling convention quirks. P/Invoke from C#
;     loads symbols by literal name, so name decoration would silently
;     break linkage on an MSVC version bump.
;   - Acts as a single-source-of-truth for the public ABI: anything not
;     listed here is internal and can be refactored freely.
;   - Tools like dumpbin /exports show this list directly, making it
;     trivial to verify the DLL surface matches what C# expects.
;
; Add new exports here AND add the matching __declspec / extern "C"
; declaration in include/engine_api.h. Phase 0 starts with the lifecycle
; quartet; Phases 1-4 add: Aion2Fun_FeedPacket, Aion2Fun_SetOnXxx callbacks,
; etc. — see TodoWrite list for full plan.

; LIBRARY directive omitted — TargetName from the .vcxproj is the
; authoritative output name. Including a LIBRARY line here triggers
; LNK4070 when the names diverge across configs, and the line is
; ignored by the linker anyway when /OUT: is supplied (it always is
; under MSBuild).

EXPORTS
    Aion2Fun_GetVersion         @1
    Aion2Fun_Init               @2
    Aion2Fun_Shutdown           @3
    Aion2Fun_SetLogCallback     @4
